# Apply Markdown Edit

## Summary
Host command — apply a targeted edit to markdown content only (for example .md/.markdown text). This command is not for source code edits such as .gts/.ts/.js/.json files.. Available to
cards and commands via the runtime loader, and to AI assistant rooms as a
tool.

## Example
```ts
import ApplyMarkdownEditTool from '@cardstack/boxel-host/commands/apply-markdown-edit';

let result = await new ApplyMarkdownEditTool(commandContext).execute({
  /* input fields */
} as any);
```
`commandContext` comes from `@context.commandContext` inside any card
format. In an AI room the same tool is invoked by name (action verb: Apply Markdown Edit).
